able.mono.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable.mono - Windows 10.0.19045 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600X 6-Core Processor (12 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nRichTextLabel bbcode tags bgcolor and table do not interact correctly. It appears that bgcolor is being treated as fgcolor and hiding the text in the table.\n\nBeing able to apply a bgcolor to the area of the table cells, instead of the area behind the text glyphs, would enable new use cases. Instead of just being able to highlight text with bgcolor, the bbcode formatting could produce digestible tables of information without needing to create a scene and several UI nodes.\n\nIdeally, this would be possible:\n```\n[bgcolor=red][cell]text block 1[/cell][/bgcolor]\n[bgcolor=blue][cell]text block 2[/cell][/bgcolor]\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a RichTextLabel with BBCode Enabled with the following text:\n```\n[bgcolor=teal][table=1][cell]\ntext\n[/cell][/table][/bgcolor]\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMinimal example:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6a72ecc-7451-416a-9cb7-ebd54f43a79c)","closed_by":{"login":"JimArtificer","id":1034423,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzQ0MjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1034423?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimArtificer","html_url":"https://github.com/JimArtificer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimArtificer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimArtificer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimArtificer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimArtificer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimArtificer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimArtificer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JimArtificer/repos","events_url